-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- XpressBees B2B (14). Source: XPRESSBEES/II Rate Quote.xlsx (Rate Quotation, Vas's)
-- Rs per kg by origin region x destination region (V12 keys ORIG-DEST), chargeable rounded UP to next kg.
-- Volumetric: L*B*H/27000 x 6 (CFT 6) = L*B*H/4500, so VOLUMETRIC_DIVISOR 4500 (the engine's CFT path
-- uses 28,316.85 cm3 per cubic foot, ~5% lower than XpressBees' 27,000).
-- Min chargeable 20 kg per waybill. Fuel 25% on basic. Waybill Rs 100. RTO: forward rate, no extra.
--
-- Loaded as DRAFT (not quoted) until these are settled - the engine can't express them exactly yet:
--   * Min freight Rs 350 applies to waybill + basic only; MIN_BILL compares the whole pre-tax subtotal
--     (incl. fuel and FOV), so small shipments are under-quoted. Example 20 kg W1-W1: engine 362.50
--     pre-tax, XpressBees 482.50 (350 + fuel 32.50 + FOV 100).
--   * ODA-1 Rs 3/kg min 800 vs ODA-2 Rs 7/kg min 1500: one ODA flag per pincode, so ODA-2 pincodes
--     (755 delivery pincodes) are charged the ODA-1 rate here.
--   * Green tax Rs 100 (delivery within Delhi state) not modelled (SPECIAL_CITY is used for Kerala/J&K).
--   * FOD / To-pay Rs 100 not modelled (no to-pay flag on the request).
--   * 'Min WT per Waybill Rs. 20' read as 20 kg. FOV Rs 100 read as flat per waybill.
--   * ASSUMPTION: max weight 5,000 kg (quote gives none).
-- Activate: UPDATE SO_RATE_CARD SET STATUS = 'ACTIVE' WHERE VERSION_LABEL = 'XB-B2B-2026-10'; then evict cache.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
INSERT INTO SO_RATE_CARD (SERVICE_ID, VERSION_LABEL, STATUS, DATA_STATUS, EFFECTIVE_FROM, EFFECTIVE_TO, VOLUMETRIC_DIVISOR, CFT_KG, MIN_CHARGEABLE_WEIGHT_KG, MAX_WEIGHT_KG, MAX_DISTANCE_KM, MPS_RULE, RTO_RULE, RTO_PERCENT, MIN_BILL, RATES_INCLUDE_GST, ROUNDING)
VALUES ((SELECT s.ID FROM SO_RATE_SERVICE s WHERE s.PARTNER_ID = 14 AND s.SERVICE_CODE = 'B2B_SURFACE'), 'XB-B2B-2026-10', 'DRAFT', 'CONTRACT', DATE '2026-10-01', NULL, 4500, NULL, 20, 5000, NULL, 'TOTAL', 'PERCENT_OF_FORWARD', NULL, 350, FALSE, 'CEIL_STEP');
